{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../models/", "title": "Data Models"}, "next": null, "title": "Configuration", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-docworm.config\">\n<span id=\"configuration\"></span><h1>Configuration<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-docworm.config\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>DocWorm SDK Configuration.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Loads config from, in priority order (highest first):</dt><dd><ol class=\"arabic simple\">\n<li><p>Constructor arguments (api_key, base_url)</p></li>\n<li><p>Environment variables (DOCWORM_API_KEY, DOCWORM_URL)</p></li>\n<li><p>config.yaml in standard locations</p></li>\n</ol>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>The config file is optional \u2014 for most users, just pass api_key to the constructor\nor set DOCWORM_API_KEY env var.</p>\n<p>Auth accepts a DocWorm API key (dw_live_...), sent as <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">X-API-KEY</span></code>, or a\nbearer token, sent as <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Authorization:</span> <span class=\"pre\">Bearer</span></code>.</p>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.config.load_config\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">docworm.config.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">load_config</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">api_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">base_url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../_modules/docworm/config/#load_config\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.config.load_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Load SDK config from all sources (constructor &gt; env &gt; file).</p>\n<p>Returns a dict with keys: api_key, base_url</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["models", "Data Models", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "config.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Configuration</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#docworm.config.load_config\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">load_config()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "has_maths_elements": false, "current_page_name": "config", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}